{# The bar's main buttons of the photos to straighten (`pick_first`, 0810): turn the picked
   photos now, or never turn them (a refusal kept in the index). #}
<button id="turnPicked" class="primary" type="button" title="{{ _('Turn the picked photos now: two bytes of each written, journaled, read back (Enter opens the large view)') }}">↻ {{ _("Turn these photos") }}</button>
<button id="refusePicked" class="plain" type="button" title="{{ _('Never propose a turn for the picked photos again') }}">✋ {{ _("Never turn these") }}</button>
